WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.007 --> 00:00:02.417
GEMMA CHAN
We're from the cast of...

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:05.172
KUMAIL NANJIANI
It's time to play Choose For Eternity!

00:00:05.222 --> 00:00:06.421
PHASTOS
Okay, get ready for it!

00:00:08.793 --> 00:00:10.079
SALMA HAYEK
Quesadillas!

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.180
KUMAIL NANJIANI
It's gotta be biryani.

00:00:13.231 --> 00:00:14.874
GEMMA CHAN
Sunday roast with all the trimmings.

00:00:14.925 --> 00:00:16.159
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
It's gonna be breakfast for dinner.

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:18.560
Anything with
cheese and eggs, I'm at it!

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.374
KINGO
This is really good, Gil!

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:22.477
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Grape Kool-Aid.

00:00:22.528 --> 00:00:23.469
SALMA HAYEK
Mezcal!

00:00:24.731 --> 00:00:25.684
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Vanilla milkshakes!

00:00:25.735 --> 00:00:26.568
GEMMA CHAN
Vodka!

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:31.118
SALMA HAYEK
My family, and the Eternals.

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:33.359
KUMAIL NANJIANI
I've gotta say my wife, Emily.

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:35.183
Because she might watch this.

00:00:35.233 --> 00:00:36.557
GEMMA CHAN
Richard Madden.

00:00:40.629 --> 00:00:41.431
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Pajamas.

00:00:41.482 --> 00:00:42.606
SALMA HAYEK
Pajamas!

00:00:44.804 --> 00:00:46.246
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
A onesie! That has the buttons

00:00:46.297 --> 00:00:47.756
in the back,
'cause that's just easy.

00:00:51.535 --> 00:00:52.531
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Oh my God!

00:00:52.582 --> 00:00:54.039
SALMA HAYEK
Really, you're asking me this?

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:55.682
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
This is the rudest question!

00:00:55.733 --> 00:00:56.510
SALMA HAYEK
Mango!

00:00:56.561 --> 00:00:57.394
GEMMA CHAN
Chocolate.

00:00:57.445 --> 00:00:59.446
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Bone marrow and cherries!

00:00:59.497 --> 00:01:00.172
KINGO
What?

00:01:00.223 --> 00:01:01.902
KUMAIL NANJIANI
I feel like vanilla gets, like,

00:01:01.953 --> 00:01:06.272
short shrift. Everyone thinks vanilla
is so vanilla, but vanilla's really good!

00:01:08.598 --> 00:01:09.479
SALMA HAYEK
Eternals!

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:11.265
KUMAIL NANJIANI
It's gonna sound like I'm biased,

00:01:11.316 --> 00:01:13.066
but Marvel Studios' Eternals.

00:01:13.281 --> 00:01:14.312
AJAK
It is time.

00:01:14.363 --> 00:01:15.741
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Marvel Studios' Eternals is

00:01:15.792 --> 00:01:17.090
in theaters November 5th!

00:01:17.141 --> 00:01:18.741
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Book your tickets today!

